## Style

Let's try a much more minimalist style:

- Header and footer all white, no golden line separating the header from the main text.
- Avenir font for all text.
- Footer: only the page number (not even the total number of pages), same gray as the title

section layout:

- same as right now, just update the footer

default or figure layout:

- slide title: smaller font, all caps, gray (the gray from the landing page subtitle)
- slide subtitle: normal font, capitalized, blue (the gray from the landing page title)

